\\ walk_macros.6502 - the walk's macros.

\\ A line's colour from two shades: their patterns EORed, a scanline at a time (pt_pattern_xor).
\\
\\ Inputs:
\\     X, Y: the shades
\\
\\ Outputs:
\\     pattern_even, pattern_odd: the colour
\\     A: corrupted
\\     X, Y: preserved

MACRO PATTERN_XY
    LDA shade_even,X:EOR shade_even,Y:STA pattern_even
    LDA shade_odd,X:EOR shade_odd,Y:STA pattern_odd
ENDMACRO
